    "reviews": "\u201cIts melancholic storyline, rich exploration content, and solid card battle mechanics are still worth experiencing.\u201d<br>8 \u2013 IGNCN<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s sort of like if Kafka\u2019s The Metamorphosis were turned into a videogame, and touches on the depths of what makes us human.\u201d<br>9 \u2013  Hey Poor Player<br><br>\u201cI was taken aback by Out of Hands\u2019 art direction, it\u2019s gorgeous and incredibly creative, and combined with its intriguing story and solid gameplay, it\u2019s one you shouldn\u2019t miss.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 GameGrin<br>",
